(6298637, 932461, 124815, '<td valign="top">One can''t go wrong with THE gargoyle. Kudos for climbing all the stairs! Please ask them to provide an elevator. Each time I go I twist the right knee!<br/>I wish the photo did not have the border that makes it too much like a beautiful post card: "been there, done that". 8</td>', 'One can''t go wrong with THE gargoyle. Kudos for climbing all the stairs! Please ask them to provide an elevator. Each time I go I twist the right knee!I wish the photo did not have the border that makes it too much like a beautiful post card: "been there, done that". 8', '2011-01-31 14:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6298648, 932230, 124815, '<td valign="top">Thoreau as interpreted by Turner, perhaps. Splendid picture although I am not convinced that it can stand for "Sentinel" unless we go via Thoreau''s writings. 9</td>', 'Thoreau as interpreted by Turner, perhaps. Splendid picture although I am not convinced that it can stand for "Sentinel" unless we go via Thoreau''s writings. 9', '2011-01-31 14:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
