(6298652, 932270, 54645, '<td valign="top">A good looking boy! I have two myself, five over the years, and I can attest that they are big barking babies! I had a huge male that would hide behind the speakers if the doorbell rang! My current male puppy is robustly vigilant, but still a neurotic  baby.</td>', 'A good looking boy! I have two myself, five over the years, and I can attest that they are big barking babies! I had a huge male that would hide behind the speakers if the doorbell rang! My current male puppy is robustly vigilant, but still a neurotic  baby.', '2011-01-31 14:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6298659, 932836, 124815, '<td valign="top">Great composition. I just wish that the photo was cut from the top a bit more, to the top of the second column and get more of the suffocating feeling. 9</td>', 'Great composition. I just wish that the photo was cut from the top a bit more, to the top of the second column and get more of the suffocating feeling. 9', '2011-01-31 14:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
