(6298770, 932698, 108069, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image. Foreground is nicely framed and the clouds are a lovely painting. B&amp;W a nice choice. Great silvery tones. Should certainly ribbon.</td>', 'Wonderful image. Foreground is nicely framed and the clouds are a lovely painting. B&W a nice choice. Great silvery tones. Should certainly ribbon.', '2011-01-31 16:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
