(6298778, 932770, 113419, '<td valign="top">imho - the way your backdrop is hanging doesn''t do much for this picture; it somehow makes the dog look as if it is stuck down in a valley.  Although I do think the color is good as it is a great contrast to the golden color of the dog.  I also think that if you could have gotten the dog to sit behind the shoes, so the shoew were at it''s feet, as if it were daring someone to take them -  it would have been more effective than the dog walking over them.  I also know that it''s VERY hard to get a dog to pose the way you want it too.</td>', 'imho - the way your backdrop is hanging doesn''t do much for this picture; it somehow makes the dog look as if it is stuck down in a valley.  Although I do think the color is good as it is a great contrast to the golden color of the dog.  I also think that if you could have gotten the dog to sit behind the shoes, so the shoew were at it''s feet, as if it were daring someone to take them -  it would have been more effective than the dog walking over them.  I also know that it''s VERY hard to get a dog to pose the way you want it too.', '2011-01-31 16:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6298779, 932140, 108069, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. You done Seattle proud. Probably pretty rare to get t his capture in the winter. Nice to see the snow on the range extend further than the typical cap. So sharp, as well. Sweet.</td>', 'Wonderful shot. You done Seattle proud. Probably pretty rare to get t his capture in the winter. Nice to see the snow on the range extend further than the typical cap. So sharp, as well. Sweet.', '2011-01-31 16:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
